    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deckbuilding \u00d7 Sanity Gambit<br>Build your deck on the brink of madness! Each deep-sea catch can be processed into distinct cards - will you craft them or offer as sacrifices? Your choices drastically alter combat tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abyssal Expedition<br>Every voyage is a life-or-death gamble. What awaits at the end of your line - precious supplies or unspeakable horrors... Dive deeper or retreat? Remember, your peaceful fishing village is gone forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cursed Relics<br>Ancient artifacts grant game-changing power, but every gift has its price - sometimes costing your sanity, memories, or even parts of your deck...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sanity System Warning<br>Monster attacks drain both HP and SAN. When sanity hits zero, you'll gain &quot;special abilities&quot;... if what remains can still be called &quot;you&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The deepest ocean isn't water, but despair.&quot;<br>When the line trembles again - will you reel in hope, or become the nightmare itself?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deckbuilding \u00d7 Sanity Gambit<br>Build your deck on the brink of madness! Each deep-sea catch can be processed into distinct cards - will you craft them or offer as sacrifices? Your choices drastically alter combat tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abyssal Expedition<br>Every voyage is a life-or-death gamble. What awaits at the end of your line - precious supplies or unspeakable horrors... Dive deeper or retreat? Remember, your peaceful fishing village is gone forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cursed Relics<br>Ancient artifacts grant game-changing power, but every gift has its price - sometimes costing your sanity, memories, or even parts of your deck...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sanity System Warning<br>Monster attacks drain both HP and SAN. When sanity hits zero, you'll gain &quot;special abilities&quot;... if what remains can still be called &quot;you&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The deepest ocean isn't water, but despair.&quot;<br>When the line trembles again - will you reel in hope, or become the nightmare itself?</p>",
